          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ക്ഷേമം — kṣēmaṁ — \"welfare; well-being\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തൊഴിലാളികളുടെ ക്ഷേമത്തിന് പുതിയ പദ്ധതി വന്നു. toḻilāḷikaḷuṭe kṣēmattinŭ putiya paddhati vannu. A new scheme has come for the workers' welfare."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "As a greeting in letters: ക്ഷേമം (kṣēmaṁ) തന്നെയല്ലേ, all well, I hope."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ക്ഷേമം (kṣēmaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit kṣema, \"giving rest or ease; safety, well-being\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
